Throw your Dream Hammer at a distant location, inflicting [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage on all targets between you and it.  After reaching its destination, the Dream Hammer will return, potentially hitting targets a second time.

Learning this talent increases the Accuracy of your Dream Hammer by [10, 20, 30, 40, 50 (TL1-5)].
